>
  <p>Vaughan homes tend to have generous frontages, and owners here expect the concrete to match. We pour double-width driveways, front walkways, porches and backyard patios across Woodbridge, Maple, Thornhill and Kleinburg, along with the newer communities along Major Mackenzie. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> backs each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>One of the most common Vaughan calls is replacing interlock. It looks sharp on day one, then heaves, shifts and weeds up as the winters stack up. Concrete done properly is the low-maintenance answer: we remove the old surface, build a compacted granular base, and pour a surface that stays level for decades.</p>

  <h2>Built for the load</h2>
  <p>A double driveway carries two vehicles every day, and Vaughan driveways often see work trucks and deliveries too. We spec thickness and base depth for the actual load, place control joints to manage shrinkage, and finish with a broom texture for winter grip. The result looks clean and stays that way.</p>

  <h2>What we pour in Vaughan</h2>
  <p>Vaughan jobs usually fall into a few categories:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, single and double width, new pours and replacements</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> sized for real outdoor living</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-porches/">porches</a> with <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">Slabs</a> for garages, sheds and additions</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">Replacement</a> of interlock and failed concrete, plus <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why Vaughan homeowners hire us</h2>
  <p>Fifteen years of GTA concrete, hundreds of finished jobs, and a quote you can take your time with. When work starts, we keep the schedule we gave you and leave the site clean.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A 2-year warranty backs every pour</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed on the finish</li>
    <li>Free quotes with no obligation attached</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Ready when you are. Send photos and a few lines through the form; every project follows our clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a>. We also cover <a href="/locations/richmond-hill/">Richmond Hill</a> and <a href="/locations/north-york/">North York</a>, so one call can handle a family or rental property nearby too.</p>
